    "Direct and strongest baseline have exact whole equal outputs; common complete norm and fullORDER admission, setup, output validation, residual and actual inverse costs must remain visible.",
    "The four-test serial Rust1.99.1 harness actually uses four different ThreadIds2/3/4/5; old static process-owner ledger cannot observe the full harness unchanged. Proposed full parity run explicitly disables the observer; separate cold single-case processes enable strict ownership. Unexpected disabled measurement must reject.",
    "The original tap ledger, original literal patch, all old929 source inputs and old21workflows stay immutable; any new observer/coverage hooks belong to a separate derivative and versioned ledger."
  ],
